[{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0333","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0333.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12233","title":"思科 IOS 通用工业协议 CIP 包拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 12.4 至 15.6 版本中 Common Industrial Protocol (CIP) 功能实现存在多个漏洞，源于对特制 CIP 数据包的解析不当。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送精心构造的 CIP 数据包，触发设备重新加载，导致拒绝服务 (DoS) 状况。该漏洞影响运行上述版本 Cisco IOS 的网络设备，攻击无需用户交互且可远程利用，CVSS 3.1 评分 7.5 (HIGH)，攻击向量为网络 (AV:N)，攻击复杂度低 (AC:L)，无需权限 (PR:N)，可用性影响高 (A:H)。Cisco Bug ID: CSCuz95334。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12233"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-09-29T01:34:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:56Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Cisco IOS 至 15.6(3)M1 或更高版本（如 15.7(3)M、16.3.1 及以上版本），修复 CIP 协议解析漏洞。如暂时无法升级，请在防火墙或边界设备上配置 ACL 拒绝非信任源 IP 访问 UDP/44818 (CIP/EtherNet/IP) 端口，并限制设备仅接受受信网段的 CIP 流量，临时缓解 DoS 攻击风险。升级前请备份配置并参考 Cisco Security Advisory cisco-sa-20170927-cip 确认适用固件版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101038","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039459","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170927-cip","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-12233","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12233.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1dac7e3201a376abf5c74e8edebb6384afa032f/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12233.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-12233","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-12233.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/06bd4bafa29f2b5ddfa107ad565d92d39b9a40e1/SSVC/data/2017/CVE-2017-12233.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2017.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-h9rm-4rp6-464p/GHSA-h9rm-4rp6-464p.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-12233.md","https://github.com/gadievron/raptor/blob/a6676878a873119d1385aba4231fcaf062a7cf15/packages/sca/data/calibration/kev_signals.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0333.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0309","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12231","title":"Cisco IOS NAT H.323 RAS 消息处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco IOS 12.4 至 15.6 版本的网络地址转换（NAT）功能中存在资源管理漏洞。该漏洞源于设备在处理使用注册、许可和状态（RAS）协议的 H.323 消息时，NAT 应用层网关（ALG）对 IPv4 数据包的转换存在缺陷。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送特制的 H.323 RAS 数据包触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致设备崩溃并重新加载，造成拒绝服务（DoS）。默认情况下，Cisco 设备为 H.323 RAS 消息启用了 NAT ALG，因此大量设备受影响。Cisco 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12231"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-09-29T01:34:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:55Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cisco IOS 至包含 CSCvc57217 修复的版本（如 15.6(3)M 及以上），或参考 cisco-sa-20170927-nat 公告中的固定版本列表。如无法立即升级，可在受影响设备上禁用 H.323 NAT ALG 功能（命令：no ip nat service h323 ras），作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101039","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039449","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170927-nat","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-12231","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2017/CVE-2017-12231.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12231.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-12231","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1dac7e3201a376abf5c74e8edebb6384afa032f/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12231.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-12231.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2017.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-12231.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1c8e3f4146e1bef501493d1237acb1611ea8f707/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-83rp-43rf-7hmv/GHSA-83rp-43rf-7hmv.json","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/61a029b6511620ca4b0f0144ecf0f6b5056f65f9/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0309.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0012","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12238","title":"Cisco IOS Catalyst 6800系列交换机 VPLS 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco Catalyst 6800 系列交换机运行特定版本 Cisco IOS 软件时，其虚拟专用局域网服务（VPLS）功能存在内存管理缺陷。未经身份认证的相邻攻击者可通过在受影响设备的 MAC 地址表中创建大量 VPLS 生成的 MAC 条目来触发该漏洞，导致 C6800-16P10G 或 C6800-16P10G-XL 类型线卡崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行 Cisco IOS 15.0 至 15.4 版本且配置了 VPLS 并使用 Supervisor Engine 6T 的 Catalyst 6800 系列交换机，攻击者需与目标设备处于同一广播域。Cisco 已发布安全公告（CSCva61927）修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12238"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-09-29T01:34:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:56Z","remediation":"登录 Cisco.com 使用 Cisco IOS Software Checker 工具（https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/selectIOSVersion.x）输入当前 IOS 版本号，查询并升级到对应修复版本。受影响设备为 Catalyst 6800 系列交换机（配备 C6800-16P10G 或 C6800-16P10G-XL 线卡且启用 VPLS），升级前确认设备内存和硬件兼容性。无服务合同的用户可联系 Cisco TAC（https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/support/web/tsd-cisco-worldwide-contacts.html）获取免费升级。该漏洞无临时缓解措施，必须通过升级修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101040","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039453","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170927-vpls","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-12238","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12238.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/49bdd0da7f9ed7eb2c6a7d376de641a46364c00a/cves/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12238.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-12238","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1dac7e3201a376abf5c74e8edebb6384afa032f/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12238.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-12238.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2017.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-12238.csv","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d91e95989ea5d3a9186ceb621d53a71dff03cab4/advisories/unreviewed/2022/05/GHSA-g8w4-jc9x-6qpc/GHSA-g8w4-jc9x-6qpc.json","https://github.com/KaweGG/vulnerability_tracker/blob/01de5763b71f6c005791d4aa8121132990782604/cves/CVE-2017-12238.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0010","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12232","title":"Cisco IOS ISR G2 路由器以太网帧拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco Integrated Services Routers Generation 2 (ISR G2) 系列路由器上运行的 Cisco IOS 软件 15.0 至 15.6 版本存在以太网帧分类错误漏洞。未经身份认证的相邻攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的以太网帧，触发设备重新加载，导致拒绝服务（DoS）条件。该漏洞源于设备对以太网帧的错误分类，攻击者无需任何认证即可在相邻网络内发起攻击，影响设备可用性。Cisco 已发布安全公告（CSCvc03809）并提供修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12232"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-09-29T01:34:48Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:02:55Z","remediation":"立即升级 Cisco IOS 至修复 CSCvc03809 的版本，具体修复版本可通过 Cisco IOS Software Checker 工具（https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/selectIOSVersion.x）查询。由于该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录且存在野外利用，建议优先升级至最新稳定版。该漏洞无临时缓解措施（workaround），必须通过软件升级彻底修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101044","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039452","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20170927-rbip-dos","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-12232","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12232.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3fc46d7716e9a0dd9635d13e2bff8fffb122a860/cves/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12232.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-12232","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/e1dac7e3201a376abf5c74e8edebb6384afa032f/2017/12xxx/CVE-2017-12232.json","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2017-12232.txt","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/README.md","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2017.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/63008d9134e74f63e93e48616bac78e5f7abdf5b/data_single/2017/CVE-2017-12232.csv","https://github.com/gadievron/raptor/blob/4e4db9518637c571cb8904ba57f0ff8fc56c7403/packages/sca/data/calibration/kev_signals.json","https://github.com/openctibr/threatFeeds/blob/61a029b6511620ca4b0f0144ecf0f6b5056f65f9/ExploitableVulnerabilitiesFeed.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0047","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0047.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-14849","title":"Node.js 目录穿越漏洞","description":"Node.js 8.5.0 至 8.6.0 版本中存在目录穿越漏洞（CWE-22），由于路径规范化处理与社区模块的路径名验证逻辑不兼容，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用 \"../\" 序列绕过路径限制，读取服务器上的任意文件（如 /etc/passwd、应用源码等敏感文件）。该漏洞影响范围广，攻击复杂度低，可导致敏感信息泄露，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至 Node.js 8.6.0 及以上版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2017-14849"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-28T01:29:02Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:06:51Z","remediation":"立即将 Node.js 升级至 8.6.0 及以上版本（8.x 分支建议升级至 8.9.0 LTS 或更高版本），该漏洞在 8.6.0 中已修复。如无法升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）添加路径过滤规则，拦截包含 `../` 的 URL 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101056","https://nodejs.org/en/blog/vulnerability/september-2017-path-validation/","https://twitter.com/nodejs/status/913131152868876288","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14849.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-14849.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/node/CVE-2017-14849/README.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14849.yaml","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/%E4%B8%AD%E9%97%B4%E4%BB%B6%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E/Node.js%20%E7%9B%AE%E5%BD%95%E7%A9%BF%E8%B6%8A%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%20CVE-2017-14849.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2017-14849-2940.yaml","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/Node.js/%EF%BC%88CVE-2017-14849%EF%BC%89Node.js%20%E7%9B%AE%E5%BD%95%E7%A9%BF%E8%B6%8A%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2017-14849.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2017-14849_4.yaml","https://github.com/govbk/WIKI-POC-EXP/blob/7d1194429dab9f9dd8139408e79b70ddb41a468f/%E9%9B%B6%E7%BB%84%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3/173-Node.js/001-%EF%BC%88CVE-2017-14849%EF%BC%89Node.js%20%E7%9B%AE%E5%BD%95%E7%A9%BF%E8%B6%8A%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2017/14xxx/CVE-2017-14849.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0047.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0043","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0043.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-14622","title":"2kb Amazon Affiliates Store WordPress插件 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress 插件 2kb Amazon Affiliates Store 2.1.1 之前版本（含 2.1.0 及更早）在后台管理页面 wp-admin/admin.php 的 kbAmz 页面中存在多处跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。攻击者可在未经充分过滤的情况下，通过 page 或 kbAction 参数注入任意 Web 脚本或 HTML。该漏洞影响已安装该插件的 WordPress 站点，攻击条件为网络可达且需诱使具备相应权限的用户（通常为管理员）访问恶意构造的链接（UI:R）。成功利用后可在受害者浏览器上下文中执行恶意脚本，导致会话劫持、权限提升或恶意操作，CVSS 3.0 评分为 6.1（中危）。厂商已在 2.1.1 版本中修复相关参数输出过滤问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-14622"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-28T01:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:06:30Z","remediation":"将 WordPress 插件 2kb Amazon Affiliates Store 升级至 2.1.1 或更高版本以修复 page 与 kbAction 参数的 XSS。可在后台「插件」中更新，或手动下载官方包替换 wp-content/plugins/2kb-amazon-affiliates-store。若暂无法升级，请停用并删除该插件，限制非必要管理员账号并避免点击不可信后台链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/101050","https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/144261/WordPress-2kb-Amazon-Affiliates-Store-2.1.0-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://wordpress.org/plugins/2kb-amazon-affiliates-store/#developers","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14622.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-14622.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14622.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2017/14xxx/CVE-2017-14622.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-14622","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2017-14622_4.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2017-14622_5.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0f7d9238ba77f900663100d40113352eb3a480d7/CVE/data/2017/CVE-2017-14622.json","https://github.com/b1ank1108/VulSentinel/blob/2e506c712049bee418e3889a2f3ef699e32aabe0/reports/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14622.md","https://github.com/Terry-ten/AI-POC/blob/62e60c784027e40d64b94669324ee032f1659f14/pocs/nuclei/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14622.yaml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/515191e20e130b861e329f31ab5415fff4608f3d/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-146xx/CVE-2017-14622.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0043.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0040","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0040.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-14524","title":"OpenText Documentum Administrator 开放重定向漏洞","description":"OpenText Documentum Administrator 7.2.0180.0055 存在多个开放重定向漏洞（CWE-601）。远程攻击者可通过以下两种方式将用户重定向至任意恶意网站并实施钓鱼攻击：1) 在 xda/help/en/default.htm 页面的 startat 参数中构造恶意 URL；2) 在 xda/component/virtuallinkconnect 页面的 redirectUrl 参数中插入 /%09/（斜杠编码水平制表符后跟斜杠）后接恶意域名。攻击者无需认证即可利用，但需要诱导用户点击特制链接，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-14524"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-28T01:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:06:19Z","remediation":"升级 OpenText Documentum Administrator 至 7.2.0180.0055 以上版本，Documentum Webtop 升级至 6.8.0160.0073 以上版本（补丁编号 68982774，需登录 OpenText 知识库获取）。如无法立即升级，在反向代理或 WAF 层面拦截 `startat` 和 `redirectUrl` 参数中的外部域名及 `/%09/` 编码序列，并对用户输入的重定向目标进行白名单校验，仅允许跳转到受信内部域名。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2017/Sep/57","https://knowledge.opentext.com/knowledge/llisapi.dll/Open/68982774","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14524.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-14524.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14524.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cc838d0e5ff34a3026c5292897b23b79aee8bacf/cves/2017/14xxx/CVE-2017-14524.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/cve-2017-14524.yaml","https://github.com/rix4uni/nucleihub-templates/blob/579a0234551b9e0e322460a62dc77bd6109e4aff/nucleihub-templates/CVE-2017-14524_2.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-14524.rules","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/515191e20e130b861e329f31ab5415fff4608f3d/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-145xx/CVE-2017-14524.json","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder3/cve-2017-14524.yaml","https://github.com/Haxxnet/FireAbend-NG/blob/5ba51daa31a0bcf85b4785f50f68baa4904ea9d9/tools/nuclei/nuclei-templates/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14524.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-14524.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0040.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0046","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0046.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-14725","title":"WordPress 用户和术语编辑屏幕开放重定向漏洞","description":"WordPress 4.8.2 之前版本中的 wp-admin/edit-tag-form.php 和 wp-admin/user-edit.php 存在开放重定向漏洞（CWE-601）。该漏洞允许已登录的低权限用户通过特制的 URL 参数将用户重定向到任意外部恶意网站，结合社会工程学可诱导用户访问钓鱼页面。攻击者无需认证即可利用该漏洞的前提是诱使具有登录状态的管理员或用户点击恶意链接，从而实现钓鱼攻击或绕过 URL 验证机制。WordPress 官方已在 4.8.2 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2017-14725"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-23T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:06:40Z","remediation":"立即升级 WordPress 至 4.8.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 wp-admin/edit-tag-form.php 和 wp-admin/user-edit.php 中的开放重定向漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）层面配置规则拦截包含非本站域名的 redirect_to 参数请求，或通过 WordPress 安全插件限制重定向目标域名白名单。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100912","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039553","https://core.trac.wordpress.org/changeset/41398","https://wordpress.org/news/2017/09/wordpress-4-8-2-security-and-maintenance-release/","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/8910","https://www.debian.org/security/2017/dsa-3997","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14725.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-14725.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14725.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1842f861696b8e0d2a79b27d77e1bfea36333d86/cves/2017/14xxx/CVE-2017-14725.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-14725.rules","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/2a2183b97032e27dffc48e0c05258a59a58abd74/osv/cve/2017/UBUNTU-CVE-2017-14725.json","https://github.com/mssalvatore/ubuntu-cve-tracker-mirror/blob/393245887b9fdc3ecd3096a44e0373d9fb7038a6/active/CVE-2017-14725","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2017-14725_3.yaml","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2017/CVE-2017-14725.md","https://github.com/runZeroInc/nuclei-templates/blob/d6fe395a24bf199f4378463556cdb6358fb8d2be/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14725.yaml","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2017-14725_8.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0046.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0045","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0045.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-14651","title":"WSO2 Data Analytics Server 3.1.0 add_collection_ajaxprocessor.jsp 参数跨站脚本攻击","description":"tags.<value>WSO2 Data Analytics Server 3.1.0 版本的 add_collection_ajaxprocessor.jsp 页面存在反射型跨站脚本漏洞（CWE-79），攻击者可通过向该页面发送包含恶意脚本的 collectionName 或 parentPath 参数，在受害者浏览器中注入并执行任意 JavaScript 代码。该漏洞无需身份认证即可触发，攻击条件宽松，影响所有使用受影响版本的 WSO2 Data Analytics Server 用户，可能导致会话劫持、凭据窃取或钓鱼攻击等后续危害。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-14651"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-21T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:06:34Z","remediation":"立即将 WSO2 Data Analytics Server 从 3.1.0 升级至 3.2.0 或更高版本以修复 XSS 漏洞。在无法升级前，可对 collectionName 和 parentPath 参数进行输入过滤与输出编码，限制管理控制台访问来源 IP 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cybersecurityworks.com/zerodays/cve-2017-14651-wso2.html","https://docs.wso2.com/display/Security/Security+Advisory+WSO2-2017-0265","https://github.com/cybersecurityworks/Disclosed/issues/15","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14651.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-14651.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-14651.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7040aa3cef70d03b2345cd387b32b51374b6a04e/cves/2017/14xxx/CVE-2017-14651.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2017-14651.js","https://github.com/0xKayala/Custom-Nuclei-Templates/blob/1940dfd29577590f076c89dec5c30d809d68f210/8001-to-9000-templates/cve-2017-14651-2938.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/CVE-2017-14651.yaml","https://github.com/exploit-io/nuclei-templates/blob/a4b7182985a6e45df346cfe45242d40455e152b5/templates/cve-2017-14651-2936.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-14651/poc/nuclei/CVE-2017-14651.yaml","https://github.com/TheMirkin/CVE-List-Public-Exploits/blob/f496d51148a2b151f14fe6d0bef5b42ee27f6ccb/CVE%20List/2017/14xxx/CVE-2017-14651.json","https://github.com/coreruleset/seaweed-reports/blob/3e2a1bd3dbca1b431f18ed0dabb71fa729d4d059/2022/Sep/11/xssArtifact/xssReport.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0045.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0034","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0034.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12611","title":"Apache Struts2 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Apache Struts2 的 Freemarker 标签处理中存在远程代码执行漏洞（S2-053），当开发者在 Freemarker 标签中使用表达式而非字符串字面量时，攻击者可构造恶意请求触发 OGNL 表达式注入，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Struts2 2.0.0 至 2.3.33 以及 2.5 至 2.5.10.1 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程利用，获取服务器完全控制权。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12611"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-20T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:03:37Z","remediation":"升级 Apache Struts 至 2.3.34（2.3.x 分支）或 2.5.12 及以上版本（2.5.x 分支），该漏洞在 Freemarker 标签中因未正确转义表达式导致 RCE。如无法立即升级，可在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则拦截包含 `%{` 或 `${\\` 等 OGNL 表达式特征的请求参数作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.arubanetworks.com/assets/alert/ARUBA-PSA-2017-003.txt","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/alert-cve-2017-9805-3889403.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100829","https://kb.netapp.com/support/s/article/ka51A000000CgttQAC/NTAP-20170911-0001","https://struts.apache.org/docs/s2-053.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44556","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12611.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12611.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/d0611a30d788ecc6797a40a15a38427bf0c3c17b/2017/CVE-2017-12611.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/4924c84cac6ce9772babf48587bed8df9d0040d0/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12611.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2017-12611-2894.yaml","https://github.com/qazbnm456/awesome-cve-poc/blob/fc862e38e03ea68cdc62618d14891a426daff1a4/CVE-2017-12611.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/50f657ad5d1fd5bd0d62718361ee31e898f44d48/data/2017/CVE-2017-12611-brianwrf_S2-053-CVE-2017-12611.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-12611","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/cve-2017-12611-2897.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v2/C/CVE-2017-12611-2897.yaml","https://github.com/govbk/WIKI-POC-EXP/blob/7d1194429dab9f9dd8139408e79b70ddb41a468f/%E9%9B%B6%E7%BB%84%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3/160-Apache%20Struts/025-%EF%BC%88CVE-2017-12611%EF%BC%89S2-053.md","https://github.com/brianwrf/S2-053-CVE-2017-12611","https://github.com/tcetin704/CVE-2017-12611","https://github.com/zeynepsilao/CVE-2017-12611_Exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0034.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0506","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0506.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-12615","title":"Apache Tomcat PUT请求文件上传远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 在 Windows 系统上存在文件上传远程代码执行漏洞。当 Tomcat 的 Default Servlet 的 readonly 初始化参数被设置为 false（即允许 HTTP PUT 方法）时，远程攻击者可通过向服务器发送特制的 PUT 请求上传包含恶意代码的 JSP 文件，随后通过访问该 JSP 文件触发服务器端执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Apache Tomcat 7.0.0 至 7.0.79 版本，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。攻击无需身份认证，但需要目标开启 PUT 方法且为 Windows 平台。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-12615"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-19T13:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:03:37Z","remediation":"升级 Apache Tomcat 至 7.0.81 及以上版本（或 8.5.23/8.0.47/9.0.1 以上版本）。如无法升级，将 conf/web.xml 中 DefaultServlet 的 readonly 参数设为 true（默认值），禁用 PUT 方法；或在 server.xml 的 Connector 中配置 allowTrace=false 并限制 PUT 请求的 Content-Type 校验，阻止上传 JSP 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://breaktoprotect.blogspot.com/2017/09/the-case-of-cve-2017-12615-tomcat-7-put.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100901","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039392","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:3080","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:3081","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:3113","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2017:3114","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:0465","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:0466","https://github.com/breaktoprotect/CVE-2017-12615","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/388a323769f1dff84c9ec905455aa73fbcb20338e3c7eb131457f708%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/3d19773b4cf0377db62d1e9328bf9160bf1819f04f988315086931d7%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/845312a10aabbe2c499fca94003881d2c79fc993d85f34c1f5c77424%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/8fcb1e2d5895413abcf266f011b9918ae03e0b7daceb118ffbf23f8c%40%3Cannounce.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r6d03e45b81eab03580cf7f8bb51cb3e9a1b10a2cc0c6a2d3cc92ed0c%40%3Cannounce.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r9136ff5b13e4f1941360b5a309efee2c114a14855578c3a2cbe5d19c%40%3Cdev.tomcat.apache.org%3E","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20171018-0001/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42953/","https://www.synology.com/support/security/Synology_SA_17_54_Tomcat","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-12615","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42953","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-12615.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-12615.md","https://github.com/zhzyker/exphub/blob/946405b3447dbaf2a5eb49e2f56ec33fe1165e49/tomcat/cve-2017-12615_cmd.py","https://github.com/nixawk/labs/blob/ce800ddc00a8bbf716afe754a1e81e58570b8c50/CVE-2017-12615/exploit_CVE-2017-12615.py","https://github.com/fofapro/vulfocus/blob/4b7a2eaacce4ed770f289e6e72f7240da1e16c74/writeup/CVE-2017-12615/CVE-2017-12615.md","https://github.com/amcai/myscan/blob/c0ed549669ec76cc9fea660554943244cbdd703b/myscan/pocs/perfolder/tomcat/poc_tomcat_cve-2017-12615_2017.py","https://github.com/gobysec/GobyVuls/blob/a5de8e3be10d51a94e0977ecd8086c176251229f/Tomcat/CVE-2017-12615/README.md","https://github.com/lofiCafe/PoC-Bank/blob/d02ccfb88d72f0bc7bc260f78844799f4dcb0418/CVE-2017-12615/CVE-2017-12615.py","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/50f657ad5d1fd5bd0d62718361ee31e898f44d48/data/2017/CVE-2017-12615-tpt11fb_AttackTomcat.md","https://github.com/Coldwave96/PocLibrary/blob/4bdc069c257f441379e9fd428ac8df7d4f5e9ca9/Library/Tomcat/cve-2017-12615_cmd.txt","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2017/CVE-2017-12615/vultarget/README.zh-cn.md","https://github.com/lizhianyuguangming/TomcatScanPro","https://github.com/tpt11fb/AttackTomcat","https://github.com/mefulton/cve-2017-12615","https://github.com/xiaokp7/Tomcat_PUT_GUI_EXP"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0506.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-0506.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0506.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1306","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1306.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-9805","title":"Apache Struts2 S2-052 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Apache Struts2 REST 插件在 2.1.1 至 2.3.x（<2.3.34）和 2.5.x（<2.5.13）版本中使用了 XStreamHandler，但在反序列化 XML 时并未进行任何类型过滤，这为攻击者提供了通过恶意 XML 负载实现远程代码执行的途径。攻击者无需任何权限即可远程触发此漏洞，攻击难度较高，但一旦成功 exploited，将导致目标系统完全控制权丧失。受影响产品涵盖 Apache Struts2 2.1.6 至 2.3.33 版本以及 2.5 至 2.5.12 版本，攻击者可构造恶意 XML 载荷，利用 Struts2 REST 插件的反序列化实现代码执行，危害等级与 CVSS 8.1 高危相似，攻击者可横向移动、窃取敏感数据或破坏系统完整性，一旦成功引发将导致系统遭受严重破坏，攻击者可完全掌控目标服务器权限，相当于授予了攻击者对目标系统的完全控制权。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-9805"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-15T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:28:57Z","remediation":"升级 Apache Struts2 到 2.5.13 或更高版本，关闭支持 XStream 的 REST 插件或禁用 XML 反序列化功能。如无法立即升级，可在 web.xml 中添加过滤器阻止危险的 XML 解析，暂时缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/alert-cve-2017-9805-3889403.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100609","http://www.securitytracker.