E-2017-9805.md","https://github.com/mazen160/struts-pwn_CVE-2017-9805","https://github.com/luc10/struts-rce-cve-2017-9805","https://github.com/chrisjd20/cve-2017-9805.py","https://github.com/0x00-0x00/-CVE-2017-9805","https://github.com/Lone-Ranger/apache-struts-pwn_CVE-2017-9805"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-1306.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-1306.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1306.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-1208","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-1208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-8759","title":"Microsoft .NET Framework 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft .NET Framework 的 WSDL 解析器在处理 SOAP 请求时存在代码注入漏洞（CWE-94）。攻击者可构造特制的 Office 文档或应用程序，在其中嵌入恶意 SOAP/WSDL 内容，当用户打开该恶意文档时，.NET Framework 的 SoapFormatter 组件未能正确验证输入，导致任意代码以当前用户权限执行。该漏洞影响 .NET Framework 2.0 至 4.7 版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。攻击需要用户交互（如打开邮件附件或点击链接），成功利用可完全控制受影响的系统。Microsoft 已于 2017 年 9 月安全更新中修复，CISA 已将其列入已知被利用漏洞目录。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2017-8759"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2017-09-13T01:29:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:26:54Z","remediation":"升级 Microsoft .NET Framework 至安全版本：安装 Microsoft 2017 年 9 月安全更新（KB4038874/KB4040973/KB4040980 等），将 .NET Framework 更新至 4.7.1 或更高版本。对于无法升级的系统，可限制用户打开来自不可信来源的 Office 文档，并启用 Windows Defender 攻击面减少规则阻止 Office 应用创建子进程。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100742","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039324","https://github.com/GitHubAssessments/CVE_Assessments_01_2020","https://github.com/bhdresh/CVE-2017-8759","https://github.com/nccgroup/CVE-2017-8759","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2017-8759","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42711/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2017-8759","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42711","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-8759.md","https://github.com/bhdresh/CVE-2017-8759/blob/b7e8096d166392357e6cad3cd25eb3fc12e48da3/cve-2017-8759_toolkit.py","https://github.com/houjingyi233/office-exploit-case-study/blob/09de49e31b83b4348c9e892bfde1ef1f597bc38a/CVE-2017-8759/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-8759","https://github.com/redstackio/redstack-vault/blob/85cd4fca816d70b450af0cac6ca430e7220f41fb/tools/Exploit-Toolkit-CVE-2017-8759.md","https://github.com/Heptagrams/Heptagram/blob/a4ce8d69730bc2ce39a88950a3c7c3c7805aee81/Windows%20Office/CVE-2017-8759/readme.md","https://github.com/ashr/CVE-2017-8759-exploits/blob/439583d58ed6a41f56fdeb74b93cfc93793b0b99/CVE-2017-8759.vbs","https://github.com/rmusser01/Infosec_Reference/blob/af8b68e2194e695c542eb76fba762d2f0a19a0dc/Draft/Phishing.md","https://github.com/Simpsonpt/AppSecEzine/blob/5f446fcfcccf21c49b6f4258aeb7ced58439d410/Ezines/187%20-%20AppSec%20Ezine","https://github.com/SecWiki/office-exploits/blob/54322c15acdd4b837e65061308ad7d3838edba24/CVE-2017-8759/cve-2017-8759_toolkit.py","https://github.com/Voulnet/CVE-2017-8759-Exploit-sample","https://github.com/vysecurity/CVE-2017-8759","https://github.com/JonasUliana/CVE-2017-8759"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-1208.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2017/EXP-AVE-2017-1208.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-1208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0112","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0112.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-3133","title":"Fortinet FortiOS SSL-VPN 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Fortinet FortiOS 5.6.0 及之前版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，位于 SSL-VPN 的 Replacement Message HTML 功能中。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向该功能注入恶意脚本代码，当管理员或用户访问受影响的 SSL-VPN 页面时，注入的脚本会在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露或未授权操作。该漏洞影响广泛部署的 Fortinet 防火墙设备，攻击复杂度低，需用户交互触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-3133"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-12T02:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:17:35Z","remediation":"升级 FortiOS 至 5.6.1 或更高版本。在 FortiGate 管理界面中，检查 SSL-VPN 门户的 Replacement Message HTML 自定义内容，移除或转义所有用户可控的输入参数。如无法立即升级，可在 SSL-VPN 设置中禁用 Replacement Message 自定义 HTML 功能，并限制 SSL-VPN 管理界面的访问来源 IP。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100009","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039020","https://fortiguard.com/advisory/FG-IR-17-104","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42388/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42388","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-3133.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-3133.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/d45959218d975ac3d65b6dea81478745e4a6e03d/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-3133.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/3xxx/CVE-2017-3133.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2017/3xxx/CVE-2017-3133.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/881db81e73cc7e2f9f510b557401bea4324e5731/plugins/fortinet/fortios/CVE-2017-3133.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2017/CVE-2017-3133.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/485b16e111d5be129c27a026bd0160d48eb6b893/SSVC/data/2017/CVE-2017-3133.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2017/CVE-2017-3133","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2017/CVE-2017-3133.rules","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-3133.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2017/POC-AVE-2017-0112.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2017/AVE-2017-0112.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2017-0110","file_name":"2017/AVE-2017-0110.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2017-3132","title":"Fortinet FortiOS 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Fortinet FortiOS 5.6.0及之前版本存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，该漏洞源于在激活 FortiToken 过程中对 action 输入参数缺乏充分的过滤与转义处理。远程攻击者可利用特制的请求向管理界面注入恶意脚本代码，当管理员访问受影响页面时脚本自动执行，导致在用户浏览器上下文中执行未授权操作或窃取会话凭证。攻击需诱使用户点击恶意链接或访问特制页面，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。Fortinet 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2017-3132"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2017-09-12T02:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:17:34Z","remediation":"升级 FortiOS 至 5.6.1 或更高版本。对于无法立即升级的系统，可在 FortiGate Web 管理界面中限制可访问管理 IP 范围，并禁用非必要的 FortiToken 激活功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/100009","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1039020","https://fortiguard.com/advisory/FG-IR-17-104","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/42388/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-3132.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2017/CVE-2017-3132.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/d45959218d975ac3d65b6dea81478745e4a6e03d/http/cves/2017/CVE-2017-3132.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2017/3xxx/CVE-2017-3132.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f167926487b7da90867c80cac87302a7f8196ec5/2017/3xxx/CVE-2017-3132.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/881db81e73cc7e2f9f510b557401bea4324e5731/plugins/fortinet/fortios/CVE-2017-3132.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c92